---
const library = [
  { href: '/tracks', label: 'Tracks' },
  { href: '/concepts', label: 'Concepts' },
  { href: '/lessons', label: 'Lessons' },
  { href: '/exercises', label: 'Exercises' },
  { href: '/sessions', label: 'Sessions' },
  { href: '/rubrics', label: 'Rubrics' },
  { href: '/templates', label: 'Templates' },
  { href: '/glossary', label: 'Glossary' },
  { href: '/knowledge-map', label: 'Knowledge Map' },
];
---
<footer class="mt-20 border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start justify-between gap-8">
      <div class="max-w-xs">
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-0.5">
          <span class="font-read font-extrabold text-lg tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Learning</span>
          <span class="font-read font-extrabold italic text-lg tracking-tight text-brand">Lab</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">
          Nhật ký học tập cá nhân. Đọc lại — không nhập liệu; mọi nội dung do AI ghi vào repo dưới dạng MDX.
        </p>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Thư viện" class="grid grid-cols-3 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-x-8 gap-y-2 text-sm">
        {library.map(({ href, label }) => (
          <a href={href} class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 hover:text-brand transition-colors">{label}</a>
        ))}
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 pt-5 border-t border-stone-200/70 dark:border-stone-800/70 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500">
      <span class="font-read italic">MDX là nguồn sự thật — repo là bộ nhớ, web là trang đọc.</span>
      <span>Dựng bằng Astro</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
